{"_id":"61dcc391eaf5a1de6972655b","title":"[FE] Spider-Man Script V1.0.5 (UPDATED)","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"slug":"FE-Spider-Man-Script-V1.0.5-(UPDATED)_256","verified":true,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":343093,"executes":27434,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/6605065-1641857937994.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/6605065-1641857937994.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/6605065-1641857937994.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/6605065-1641857937994.jpg"},"likeCount":14,"dislikeCount":3,"createdAt":"2022-01-10T23:38:58.000Z","updatedAt":"2022-01-10T23:38:58.000Z","lastBump":"2022-01-10T23:38:58.000Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ItsDishan/SpidermanScript/main/Spider-Man'), true))()","features":"Minor updates.\n\nChangelogs V1.0.5:\n- When you jump and land now your character will do a Spiderman style pose.\n- When you press Z while standing still then your character will do the Superhero emote. (Spiderman Backflip)\n\nBare in mind it's only version 1 so there will be bugs and what not, certain games may also have it be bannable so use at your own risk. Also there's no suit up option as of right now.\n\nControls:\nWall Climb - Go up to any wall and press X against the wall and you'll enter climb mode. Either press X again to stop or reach the top (based on how many parts the wall has). Very simple and looks cool since it's got an animation to go with it when climbing. People find it cool especially if you're dressed as Spider-Man.\n\nWeb Swing - Aim your mouse anywhere and hold Q and click, it's got a cool little animation while swinging too. There's no actual web (yet) because I don't really have any idea on how to make it possible in FE but hopefully there will be one in future.\n\nIf you guys enjoy it I'll be happy to update and continue working on it. Have fun and thanks for sticking with me :)\n\nPreview: https://imgur.com/C03KXGL (OLD)","tags":["Spiderman","ROBLOX","Filtering Enabled","Script","FE"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"61dad1be7cf90a9e0b760068","username":"Dishan","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/99b2f302d60340b69aebcbc82cdb498f99612a48b870c7cd3f7a81ca4a463874.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61dad1be7cf90a9e0b760068-1714396023712.png"},"status":"offline","id":"61dad1be7cf90a9e0b760068","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/99b2f302d60340b69aebcbc82cdb498f99612a48b870c7cd3f7a81ca4a463874.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61dad1be7cf90a9e0b760068-1714396023712.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":0,"conf":0.1,"n":{"w":0,"b":1,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":1,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T21:26:52.499Z","last":"b","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4df29","editBy":{"_id":"61dad1be7cf90a9e0b760068","username":"Dishan","status":"offline","id":"61dad1be7cf90a9e0b760068"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T23:11:38.741Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"61e46ccdadc77ecf1d973a21","commentBy":{"_id":"61e4633c4889e8d9823eeedc","username":"AuthenticTimes","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61e4633c4889e8d9823eeedc-1642360040421.png"},"createdAt":"2022-